# queue attachments — v2.2.7 re-derivation of the deferred payloads of attachments-upload-redirect-
# policy (#12), files-platform-bridge (#19), attachments-share-bridge (#20) and the composer-side
# face of session-media-source-safety (#58), regenerated against the CURRENT chain tree (the
# entry.tsx / runtime/platform/web.ts hunks sit on the cumulative post-#184/#186/#187 tree, like
# the #185/#186 precedents).
#
# Fail-closed pair: blobDataUrl no longer passes a `media:` ref through (unresolved refs throw),
# and buildPromptRequest rejects an unresolved `media:` file-part url at the wire boundary
# (recorded deviation: images are not re-checked here — both real producers build their dataUrl
